irst detectives we happened here on  New York's Upper East Side a man was  punched and kicked after a suspect  allegedly made an anti-semitic remark  now in light of these attacks the NYPD  has beefed up patrols in Jewish  neighborhoods and New York's governor  has  erected a hate crimes task force to look  into them for CBS this morning Saturday  Don Dahler New York  you
 

